## Beken SDK 音频代码分析

### 已找到的关键组件

| 组件 | 路径 | 说明 |
|------|------|------|
| Voice Service | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/components/bk_voice_service/` | 核心语音服务 |
| Voice Read Service | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/components/bk_voice_service/src/bk_voice_read_service.c` | 麦克风数据读取 |
| Voice Write Service | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/components/bk_voice_service/src/bk_voice_write_service.c` | 扬声器数据写入 |
| Onboard Mic Stream | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/include/components/bk_audio/audio_streams/onboard_mic_stream.h` | 单麦克风配置 |
| Dual DMIC Stream | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/include/components/bk_audio/audio_streams/onboard_dual_dmic_mic_stream.h` | 双麦克风配置 |
| Onboard Speaker Stream | `bk_avdk_smp/ap/include/components/bk_audio/audio_streams/onboard_speaker_stream.h` | 扬声器配置（含 PA 控制） |
| Voice Service Example | `bk_avdk_smp/projects/voice_service_example/ap/voice_service_test/cli_voice_service.c` | 示例代码 |

---

### 关键配置结构

#### 1. 麦克风配置（单 MIC）
```c
typedef struct {
    uint8_t    chl_num;      // 通道数
    uint8_t    bits;         // 位宽 (16/24)
    uint32_t   sample_rate;  // 采样率
    int32_t    dig_gain;     // 数字增益 (0x00~0x3f)
    int32_t    ana_gain;     // 模拟增益
    bool       mic_swap;     // false: MIC1, true: MIC2
    aud_adc_mode_t mode;     // ADC 模式
    aud_clk_t  clk_src;      // 时钟源
} adc_cfg_t;
```

#### 2. 扬声器配置（含 PA 控制）
```c
typedef struct {
    uint8_t    chl_num;        // 通道数
    uint32_t   sample_rate;    // 采样率
    int32_t    dig_gain;       // 数字增益
    int32_t    ana_gain;       // 模拟增益
    uint8_t    bits;           // 位宽
    bool       pa_ctrl_en;     // PA 控制使能
    uint16_t   pa_ctrl_gpio;   // PA GPIO
    uint8_t    pa_on_level;    // PA 开启电平
    uint32_t   pa_on_delay;    // PA 开启延迟 (ms)
    uint32_t   pa_off_delay;   // PA 关闭延迟 (ms)
} onboard_speaker_stream_cfg_t;
```

---

### Voice Service 使用示例

```c
#include <components/bk_voice_service.h>
#include <components/bk_voice_service_types.h>

// 1. 初始化语音服务
voice_cfg_t voice_cfg = DEFAULT_VOICE_BY_ONBOARD_MIC_SPK_CONFIG();
voice_handle_t voice_handle = bk_voice_init(&voice_cfg);

// 2. 初始化读取服务（麦克风）
voice_read_cfg_t read_cfg = {0};
read_cfg.voice_handle = voice_handle;
read_cfg.read_callback = mic_data_callback;  // 数据回调
voice_read_handle_t read_handle = bk_voice_read_init(&read_cfg);

// 3. 初始化写入服务（扬声器）
voice_write_cfg_t write_cfg = {0};
write_cfg.voice_handle = voice_handle;
voice_write_handle_t write_handle = bk_voice_write_init(&write_cfg);

// 4. 启动服务
bk_voice_start(voice_handle);
bk_voice_read_start(read_handle);
bk_voice_write_start(write_handle);

// 5. 读取麦克风数据（在回调中）
int mic_data_callback(unsigned char *data, unsigned int len, void *args) {
    // 处理麦克风数据
    return len;
}

// 6. 写入扬声器数据
bk_voice_write_frame_data(write_handle, (char *)data, size);

// 7. 停止服务
bk_voice_read_stop(read_handle);
bk_voice_write_stop(write_handle);
bk_voice_stop(voice_handle);
bk_voice_read_deinit(read_handle);
bk_voice_write_deinit(write_handle);
bk_voice_deinit(voice_handle);
```

---

### Kconfig 配置

```shell
# 基础依赖
CONFIG_ADK=y
CONFIG_ADK_RAW_STREAM=y
CONFIG_ADK_ONBOARD_MIC_STREAM=y      # 单麦克风
# 或
CONFIG_ADK_ONBOARD_DUAL_DMIC_MIC_STREAM=y  # 双麦克风
CONFIG_ADK_ONBOARD_SPEAKER_STREAM=y
CONFIG_ADK_G711_ENCODER=y
CONFIG_ADK_G711_DECODER=y
CONFIG_ADK_AEC_V3_ALGORITHM=y

# Voice Service
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE=y
CONFIG_VOICE_READ_SERVICE=y
CONFIG_VOICE_WRITE_SERVICE=y
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE_TEST=y          # 测试命令

# 可选编码器
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE_G722_ENCODER=y
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE_G722_DECODER=y
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE_OPUS_ENCODER=y
CONFIG_VOICE_SERVICE_OPUS_DECODER=y
```

